0 -20 Td (Authors: Team EdgeTech - Electrical & Computer Engineering) Tj
0 -30 Td (1. Problem Definition:) Tj
0 -15 Td (Cloud-only IoT architectures suffer from high bandwidth costs and 250ms roundtrip latency.) Tj
0 -15 Td (This project develops an edge gateway for real-time anomaly detection in vibration sensors.) Tj
0 -30 Td (2. Technical Methodology:) Tj
0 -15 Td (We deployed quantized MobileNetV2 models on a Raspberry Pi 4 running FreeRTOS and Linux.) Tj
0 -15 Td (Sensors stream acceleration data at 1 kHz over an isolated RS-485 Modbus industrial bus.) Tj
0 -30 Td (3. Implementation and Evidence:) Tj
0 -15 Td (Custom PCB shield designed with galvanic isolation to protect against electrical surges.) Tj
0 -15 Td (Firmware processes 1,000 samples/sec with 14ms local inference latency.) Tj
0 -30 Td (4. Innovation:) Tj
0 -15 Td (Novel dynamic weight pruning algorithm reduces memory footprint by 42% with no accuracy loss.) Tj
0 -30 Td (5. Testing and Validation:) Tj
0 -15 Td (Validated across 500 operating hours on a test motor rig; achieved 97.8% F1-score for bearing fault detection.) Tj
